            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Frechet+space"}> Frechet
            ) Lie
            = succeed "s." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-group"} 2-group
          .query
            %p
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Roberts"}> David Roberts
              \: As an aside, I know of two classes of spaces with explicitly constructed (i.e. not via co-killing homotopy groups) 2-connected covers: the 2-sphere and its quotients by
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
